  "scope": "The original weighted-product input and bounded Chapter15 model-topology/Chapter32 problem interfaces retain their checkpoint289 complete checked scopes. The complete revised weighted input and both bounded interfaces receive two fresh mathematical/editorial reads, the second after the clean production build and all direct images. The bounded-metric definition, correspondence gluing construction, diameter comparison and all active-set/fiber arguments are checked directly in the new self-contained proofs. The curve polar classification, ideal metric and weighted projection dependencies retain their recorded complete checked scopes. No fresh whole-chapter or independent full-proof audit.",
